          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">A worn deck is the usual reason a belt keeps dragging after it
            has been lubricated and tensioned properly.</strong> Confirm it by lifting the belt and
            looking, then flip the deck if the design allows, or replace it together with the belt
            if it does not.
          </p>
